    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><em>Dwarves shape metal like the gods shaped the first&nbsp;</em><em>dwarf.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Domain</strong>: Up to [[@lvl]] items (a sword, armor, shield and so on) that you have forged yourself is considered an adventurer level true magic item of the appropriate chakra when you or an ally wears it. The item only has the basic enchantment effect (+1 to attack and damage for a weapon), but it can acquire an additional effect through story events or icon relations.</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Spells</strong>: Blessed Steel, Heat Metal, Blade Barrier</p>"
